  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till RCN Justice &amp; D&#xe9;mocratie, belgisk NGO, under 1 &#xe5;r. Projektet skall st&#xf6;dja utvecklingen av r&#xe4;ttssystemet o &#xe5;teruppr&#xe4;tta f&#xf6;rtroendet f&#xf6;r detsamma. Detta ska ske genom insatser inom  r&#xe4;ttsystemet (utbildning, logistik o administration) o genom st&#xf6;d till civila samh&#xe4;llet genom utbildning av organisationer, forskning, dokumentation o distribution av information om m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to RCN Justice &amp; D&#xe9;mocratie, Belgian NGO, for 1 year. The project will support development of the judiciary and rehabilitate the confidence in the same. It will be done through training, logistics and administration within the judiciary and through civil society - training of NGOs, research, documentation and distribution of information about human rights.</narrative>
  </description>
